
metadata:
  book_id: "hisn-muslim"
  book_name: "Hisn al-Muslim"
  total_hadiths: "276"
  available_languages: "ar,bn,bs,de,en,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr,ur"
  ai_translated_languages: "bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr"
  ai_translation_note: "The following languages are machine-assisted translations from the Arabic via LLM, disclosed per-row with an [AI-translation] prefix: bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr. All other languages are human/scholarly translations."
  intro: "Hisn al-Muslim (The Fortress of the Muslim) by Sa'id al-Qahtani gathers the authentic supplications and remembrances of the Prophet (peace be upon him) for daily life. Presented here in 276 supplications with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ar: "حصن المسلم لسعيد القحطاني يجمع الأدعية والأذكار الصحيحة المروية عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم للحياة اليومية. يُعرض هنا في 276 دعاء بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "Hisn al-Muslim (The Fortress of the Muslim) by Sa'id al-Qahtani gathers the authentic supplications and remembrances of the Prophet (peace be upon him) for daily life. Presented here in 276 supplications with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ur: "حصن المسلم از سعید القحطانی روزمرہ زندگی کے لیے نبی کریم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم سے مروی صحیح دعاؤں و اذکار کا مجموعہ ہے۔ یہاں 276 دعائیں عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "Hisn al-Muslim (The Fortress of the Muslim) by Sa'id al-Qahtani gathers the authentic supplications and remembrances of the Prophet (peace be upon him) for daily life. Presented here in 276 supplications with Arabic, English and Urdu."
